  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "scary-outfit",
      "title": "Scary outfit",
      "anchor": "Scary_outfit",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "A total of four components of the following <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Items\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">items</a> and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Cosmetic_override\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">cosmetic overrides</a> need to be equipped or activated. For an equipped item to count, there must not be a cosmetic override active in the same slot."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "The <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie_outfit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">zombie outfit</a> suffices, and its four cheapest pieces (<a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie_mask\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">zombie mask</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie_trousers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">trousers</a>, <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie_gloves\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">gloves</a>, and <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Zombie_boots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">boots</a>) can be bought from <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Iffie%27s_Random_Costume_Shop\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Iffie&#39;s Random Costume Shop</a> located inside <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Thessalia%27s_Fine_Clothes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Thessalia&#39;s Fine Clothes</a> in central <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Varrock\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Varrock</a> for a total of 3,000 <a href=\"https://runescape.wiki/w/Coins\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">coins</a>."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "Possible spooky pieces are listed below:"
        },
